file tools/fixtures/r/rye_struct_fields_scan.sh the reader four guards needed -- count and order out of the Rye, three refusals by name
file tools/fixtures/r/rye_struct_fields_control.sh nineteen behaviors, two of them the elder predicate waving the break through
file tools/r/rye_struct_fields_witness.rish the rung that drives the control and reads the four structures the limbs stand over
file tools/m/mantra_glow_tend_limb1_witness.rish the presence leg replaced by a count-and-order leg reading the placard's own number
file tools/m/mantra_glow_tend_limb2_witness.rish the same replacement for Weave
